{
  "info": {
    "name": "Waypoint API",
    "description": "Postman collection for validating the Waypoint PoC API.\n\nRun requests in order — the collection uses variables captured from previous responses.\n\nOrder: Auth → Tasks → Status Transitions → Filtering → Quests → Epics → Profile → Deletion → Validation → API Versioning",
